  "solution": "The logic followed here is: (**1st number × 2nd number) + 5 = 3rd number.**\n\nGiven: (15, 7, 110) → (15 × 7) + 5 = 105 + 5 = 110\n\nLet's check option one by one:\n\nOption 1) (21, 4, 90) → (21 × 4) + 5 = 84 + 5 = 89 ≠ 90\n\nOption 2) (44, 2, 95) → (44 × 2) + 5 = 88 + 5 = 93 ≠ 95\n\nOption 3) (17, 2, 44) → (17 × 2) + 5 = 34 + 5 = 39 ≠ 44\n\n**Option** **4) (18, 5, 95) → (18 × 5) + 5 = 90 + 5 = 95.**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"(18, 5, 95).**",
